// Batch 004 (continued): every position's primary and secondary skill
// categories under the rules sets TP's official team list does not cover
// (CRP, CRP+ and BB2016), plus gap-fill pairs under BB2020, DB2021 and
// BB2025 that TP does not supply.
//
// Each entry is the pair's COMPLETE set: the sync flags any category an entry
// leaves out as removed. Only learnable categories appear (general, agility,
// passing, strength, mutation, devious), and a category is never both
// primary and secondary. The rulebooks' letter codes map as G general,
// A agility, P passing, S strength, M mutation, D devious.
//
// The CRP/CRP+/BB2016 pairs are exactly the regular positions whose
// characteristics 002-initial-cleanup/position-characteristics.json5
// curates, under the same "Name" position ids. Those characteristics rows
// are the anchors these entries need. Star players are left out because
// they cannot advance.
//
// A gap-fill entry must name a pair TP's official team list never supplies.
// Otherwise the next TP import replaces it with TP's set (see
// docs/import-manual/curated-files.md, "Batch 004").
//
// Sources, per rules set:
//   CRP    -- m750496a_BB_Competition_Rules_Pack.pdf, roster pages 23-25
//             (Normal column = primary, Double column = secondary).
//   CRP    -- Stunty_Leeg_Handbook_v1_0.pdf, pages 8-11, for the Stunty Leeg
//             teams the main CRP book does not list.
{
  externalSystems: [{ name: 'Name', category: 'bookkeeping' }],

  positionRulesSetSkillCategories: [
    // --- CRP: Dark Elf (CRP p.23) ---
